{"id":"631398","name":"西红柿鸡蛋捞凉饸烙","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/631398/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"3个"},{"name":"柴鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"饸饹","amount":"适量"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"半个"},{"name":"荆芥","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"玉米油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"花椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"辣椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"米醋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"少许"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"可选"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"西红柿切小块。","img":"images/631398/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡蛋炒好。","img":"images/631398/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅里适量油烧热，姜蒜，花椒，辣椒炒香。","img":"images/631398/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入西红柿丁。","img":"images/631398/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"炒成泥。","img":"images/631398/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入适量开水。","img":"images/631398/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"盐，生抽，少许味精调味儿。","img":"images/631398/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入炒好的鸡蛋，搅匀关火。","img":"images/631398/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"晾凉备用。","img":"images/631398/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"蒜加点盐捣成泥。","img":"images/631398/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"半勺清水，生抽，米醋，香油调味。","img":"images/631398/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"黄瓜擦丝。","img":"images/631398/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"荆芥叶洗净备用。","img":"images/631398/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"饸烙面适量。","img":"images/631398/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"锅里适量水烧开，下入饸饹煮两三滚儿。","img":"images/631398/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"捞出过冰水，控干水份。","img":"images/631398/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"倒入晾凉的西红柿鸡蛋卤。","img":"images/631398/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放入黄瓜丝，荆芥叶。","img":"images/631398/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"倒上调好的蒜泥，喜欢辣的放些小米椒。","img":"images/631398/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/631398/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/631398/step_21.jpg"},{"step":